{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q1088175","formula":"C₅₆H₉₈N₁₆O₁₃","hill":"C56H98N16O13","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":56.0,"H":98.0,"N":16.0,"O":13.0},"names":{"en":"Polymyxin B","ru":"Полимиксин B"},"descriptions":{"en":"Polymyxin B, sold under the brand name Poly-Rx among others, is an antibiotic used to treat meningitis, pneumonia, sepsis, and urinary tract infections. While it is useful for many Gram negative infections, it is not useful for Gram positive infections. It can be given by injection into a vein, muscle, or cerebrospinal fluid or inhaled.","ru":"Полимиксин B, продаваемый под торговой маркой Poly-Rx и другими, — антибиотик, используемый для лечения менингита, пневмонии, сепсиса и инфекций мочевыводящих путей. Препарат полезен при многих грамотрицательных инфекциях и неэффективен при грамположительных инфекциях. Его можно вводить внутривенно, внутримышечно или в спинномозговую жидкость, а также ингаляционно."},"fame":21,"pubchemCid":4868,"mass":1203.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCC(C)CCCCC(=O)NC(CCN)C(=O)NC(C(C)O)C(=O)NC(CCN)C(=O)NC1CCNC(=O)C(NC(=O)C(NC(=O)C(NC(=O)C(NC(=O)C(NC(=O)C(NC1=O)CCN)CC2=CC=CC=C2)CC(C)C)CCN)CCN)C(C)O","inchikey":"WQVJHHACXVLGBL-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"N-[4-amino-1-[[1-[[4-amino-1-oxo-1-[[6,9,18-tris(2-aminoethyl)-15-benzyl-3-(1-hydroxyethyl)-12-(2-methylpropyl)-2,5,8,11,14,17,20-heptaoxo-1,4,7,10,13,16,19-heptazacyclotricos-21-yl]amino]butan-2-yl]amino]-3-hydroxy-1-oxobutan-2-yl]amino]-1-oxobutan-2-yl]-6-methyloctanamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"4868","atoms":183,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":13.998,"y":-1.351,"z":3.019,"el":"C"},{"x":13.728,"y":-0.368,"z":1.887,"el":"C"},{"x":13.861,"y":-1.0,"z":0.492,"el":"C"},{"x":12.791,"y":-2.07,"z":0.246,"el":"C"},{"x":13.885,"y":0.054